# ESP32 Sensor Interface PCB

## Project Overview
A custom ESP32-based sensor interface PCB designed using KiCad for embedded systems and IoT applications.

## Design Features
- ESP32 DevKit interface
- DHT22 temperature and humidity sensor connector
- MQ-135 air-quality sensor connector
- Supporting resistors and sensor connections
- PCB layout and 3D visualization using KiCad

## Tools Used
- KiCad Schematic Editor
- KiCad PCB Editor
- KiCad 3D Viewer

## Design Preview
- Circuit schematic
- 2D PCB layout
- 3D PCB model

## Project Status
PCB design created in KiCad. Fabrication and hardware testing have not yet been completed.

## Skills Practised
Schematic design, footprint assignment, component placement, PCB routing, and 3D board visualization.
